Subject: [PATCH] feat(quant): add opt-in SM86 short-prefill INT8 GEMM dispatch

---
 .../ops/quantization/int8_prefill_gemm.py     | 98 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../schemes/compressed_tensors_w8a8_int8.py   | 22 +++++
 .../srt/layers/quantization/w8a8_int8.py      | 20 ++++
